window.products.push({"id":119096,"name":"Upgrade 4pcs DC97-05280W Washer Suspension Rod Kits 26 Inches Long Suitable for Samsung Washer Damper Rod Assembly Replaces AP5966911 PS11719937-1 Yea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F+FQEqOpL._SL1001_.jpg","description":"The DC97-05280W suspension rod and spring assembly is for Samsung washers. Replace Part Number: DC97-05280W, AP5966911, PS11719937, DC97-16350C, DC97-16350E, DC97-05280H, DC97-05280K, DC97-05280X, DC97-16350D, DC97-16350J. Washer Suspension rod DC97-05280W supports the washer tub and keeps it stable during unbalanced loads, acts as a shock absorber that allows the washer tub to move while helping minimize vibration in the spin mode. Replacing the four suspension rods often corrects Samsung washing machines that go out of balance and display the dc error code. If one or more of the suspension rods are broken, the washer will vibrate or shake. The DC97-05280W washer suspension rod kit is compatible for Samsung top-load washers in the WA400, WA40J, WA456, WA45H and WA45M series. Contact us for more suitable models. The DC97-05280W washer suspension rod has better quality materials to match OEM standards, not OEM, but exceed OEM quality standards. If you want a faster installation, you could get it on YouTube. We provide a worry-free 1 years return and exchange service. Please contact us first for any problems and help you solve them perfectly within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F+FQEqOpL._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"inzizik","source_asin":"B08F9ZZZ16","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-119096","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F9ZZZ16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F9ZZZ16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
