window.products.push({"id":119164,"name":"Livtor 97006931 Aluminum Range Hood Vent Grease Filter Compatible with Broan BP29, S97006931(2 Packs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mNMKNjpEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"The 97006931 range hood aluminum filters are made of high grade aluminium material, designed for long lasting use; Good replacement parts for the models 97006931, 1172137, 5-3078, 88150, 99010121, C88150, K7589000, NAA150, S5-3078, S88150, S99010121, SC88150. They can be installed easily in several minutes, also can be immersed in soapy water for easy cleaning. Livtor 2 Pcs 97006931 Range Hood Vent Grease Filters Feature: Great Performance & Function - Made of premium quality aluminium, sturdy & long-lasting. - Keep your range hood operating at good performance and improve indoor air quality. Wide Application - For replacing Broan models 40000, F40000, 41000, 42000-K, Caloric, GE, Nautilus, Nutone models RL6100F-R, RL6100F-R, SL6200-H, RL6300-H, RL6100-H, Roper & Sears. Easy Replacement & Exact Fit - Easy to install, just take your old greasy filters out, replace them with our new filters. Specifications: - Item Name: 97006931 Aluminum Range Hood Grease Filters - Material: Aluminium - Color: Silver & Blue - Size of Single Range Hood Grease Filter: 10.43 x 8.66 x 0.31 in - Weight of Single Rang Hood Filter: 3.03 oz - Package Size: 11.02 x 9.65 x 0.98 in - Package Weight: 6.28 oz - Compatibility Model: 97006931, 1172137, 5-3078, 88150, 99010121, C88150, K7589000, NAA150, S5-3078, S88150, S99010121, SC88150. Package Content: - 2 x Range Hood Vent Grease Filter 97006931 Livtor Notes: - Due to the manual measurement, please allow some slight errors in the size. - The 97006931 rang hood grease filters are not the OEM products. - Any use of the Broan brand name and model designation for the range hood filter 97006931 is made solely for the purpose of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mNMKNjpEL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Livtor","source_asin":"B08L9FBL4L","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-119164","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L9FBL4L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L9FBL4L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
