window.products.push({"id":119298,"name":"Air King AV1364 Advantage Convertible Under Cabinet Range Hood with 2-Speed Blower and 180-CFM, 7.0-Sones, 36-Inch Wide, Biscuit Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ezjETpvmL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer The Air King AV1364 Advantage Convertible Under Cabinet 36-Inch Range Hood is an ideal solution for under cabinet ventilation in your home with a sleek, low profile contemporary design. This range hood features a powerful 2-speed motor with an operating speed of 180-CFM (cubic feet per minute) at 7.0-Sones. The AV1364 includes a dual rocker on and off lighting control switch for the 60-watt cook top light (bulb not included), as well as an easy-to-remove grease filter to trap grease and other debris to keep your range hood clean. This unit allows for 3-1/4-inch by 10-inch horizontal or vertical ducting and can be converted to ductless operation with the addition of RF34 Odor Filter (sold separately) and 7-inch round ducting with the addition of the E-22A duct collar and back draft damper sold separately. The AV1364 measures 36-inches wide by 6-inches high by 18-1/2-inch in depth, has a 23-guage steel construction with a biscuit finish and comes with all of the necessary mounting screws and instruction sheets for an easy installation process. The Air King AV1364 Advantage Convertible Under Cabinet Range Hood comes with a 1-year limited warranty. Air King offers a full line of industrial grade and commercial grade air circulating fan solutions to meet almost any need you might have. Whether your need is in industrial settings such as manufacturing plants and warehouses or more commercial setting such as offices, schools or hospitals - Air King has the perfect solution for you. Powerful motors that last for years and years are what Air King's Air Circulators have come to been know as and we are not stopping now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ezjETpvmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Air King","source_asin":"B00BMZT3SW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-119298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BMZT3SW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BMZT3SW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":119299,"name":"Beaquicy WB44K10005 Oven Bake Element Suitable for GE Hotpoint Americana Oven model rb526h3ww,rb757bh1wh,rb787wh1ww,rb787ch2cc,jbs03h2wh,36291114101,a","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.27,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qge66FygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【SIZE SPECIFICATIONS】--- WB44K10005 Oven Bake Element has push-in terminals and measures approximately 17.8 inches by 17.8 inches. From mounting bracket to back 2-3/8\". From end of terminal to the mounting bracket (measuring up at an angle) 2 5/8\" between each terminal. Terminals are male spade type, Calrod is bent up at then end towards 2 mounting holes. The rated voltage is 2585 watts and the voltage is 240 volts. The package includes 1 x WB44K10005 Range Oven Bake Element. ✅【HIGHLIGHT】--- WB44K10005 ge range bake element is at the bottom of the oven and supplies the heat for baking. It only fits for electric ovens and electric ranges. The product has push on wire terminals and terminals are male spade type.Cooled element is easy to clean using only a soft sponge or cloth and warm water with mild soap solution, then wipe dry. The part can fix the following symptoms:①Little to no heat when baking②Element will not heat③Oven not heating evenly④Will Not Start. ✅【WIDE COMPATIBLE】--- Beaquicy WB44K10005 Oven Bake Element can replacement for Americana GE,Hotpoint,Kenmore Oven.►Replaces Part Numbers:WB44K10001, 824269, AP2030964, PS249238, EAP249238, 36261101000, 36261101001, 36261108000, 36261108001, 36261741000, 36261741001, 36261742000, 36261742001, 36261748000, 36261748001, 36262492000, 36262492001, 36262780100, 36262780101, 36262780102, rb525bc1ad, rb525bc1ct, rb525bc1wh, rb525bc2ad, rb525bc2ct, rb525bc2wh, rb525bc3wh, rb525bh2ct, rb525bh2wh, etc. ✅【AFTER-SALES SERVICE】--- The WB44K10005 bake element replacement supports 365 DAYS return and exchange. Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem. Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】 --- Unplug your oven or turn off the circuit breaker before installing wb44k10005 hot-point bake element. Prepare a pair of work gloves, needle-nosed pliers and a phillips screwdriver. Remove the oven door, remove the screws from the lower heating element, remove the wires from the heating element, remove the lower element to secure the new one, and then reassemble the oven in reverse. It doesn't take too long, and you can follow the Youtube videos if you have trouble installing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Qge66FygL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B087M62BBV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-119299","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B087M62BBV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B087M62BBV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
