window.products.push({"id":119536,"name":"PETSITE Countertop Water Cooler Dispenser with Ice Maker, 3 in 1 Top-Loading Hot & Cold Water Dispenser 5 Gallon, 48 LBS Daily-Ice, Portable Ice Cube ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":279.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611Esbl8sEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"3-in-1 Ice Maker: Our countertop water cooler dispenser features 3 temperature settings, which is able to provide you with hot water (≥194℉), cold water(≤46.4℉) or chill ice cubes according to your different needs. It can make 12 pieces of bullet-shaped ice cubes per cycle in just 10-13 minutes. Easy Operation & Child-safe Lock: The one-touch control panel with soft buttons and indicator lights allows you to operate the water dispenser with ease. It will remind you to add water when the water tank is empty. Better yet, the child-safe lock ensures high-level of safety, protecting your children from accidental injury. 2 Ways to Add Water: The top of the top-loading water cooler dispenser includes a water jug core that fits 3-5 gallon water bottle to ensure consistent water supply. You can also refill the water tank by manually adding water through the water jug core. User-friendly Design: The drip tray can not only avoid water accumulation or wetness on the countertop due to water spillage, but also can be removed for easy cleaning. Besides, the water dispenser is equipped with a night light, which provides you with much convenience of drinking water. Wide Range of Applications: The stainless steel water cooler dispenser with ice maker combines stylish appearance and practical functions in one. What's more, its 48 dB operating noise won't disturb your work or study, making it a perfect choice for your home, office, dormitory and other places where you need it. Any question, please contact our customer service for help. Warranty: 1 Year Warranty Against Manufacturer Defects. Whatever problems you've encountered, just feel free to contact us at anytime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/611Esbl8sEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PETSITE","source_asin":"B0B6G8VNBR","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-119536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B6G8VNBR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B6G8VNBR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
