window.products.push({"id":119621,"name":"Beaquicy 8544771 Dryer Heating Element Assembly with 279973 3392519 Thermal Fuse with 279816 Thermostat Kit - Replacement for Kenmore Whirlpool Roper ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xR7oTEqeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝟖𝟓𝟒𝟒𝟕𝟕𝟏 𝐃𝐫𝐲𝐞𝐫 𝐇𝐞𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐄𝐥𝐞𝐦𝐞𝐧𝐭 𝐊𝐢𝐭】-- Includes 1 x 8544771 dryer heating element, 1 x 279973 thermal fuse & thermostat, 1 x 279816 thermostat kit and 1 x 3392519 thermal fuse.The 8544771 dryer heating element is rated at 5400 Watts 240 Volts and has 2- 5/16\" male terminals. 279973 Thermostat is a safety mechanism that prevents the dryer from overheating, and the fuse is like a backup system-it will trip at a higher temperature than the thermostat. 【𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇-𝐐𝐔𝐀𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘 𝐌𝐄𝐓𝐀𝐋】-- 8544771 Heating element is made of high-quality metal and contains a heating wire coil with a nickel-chromium content of 85%.The wire receives but resists the controlled current,causing the wire to heat up.The heat generated is used to dry the clothes in the dryer.279816 Thermostat kit includes one high-limitthermostat with a limit at 250°F,one thermalcut-off fuse with a limit at 309°F,and thewiring hardware,shuts off the motor to avoidsudden safety hazard caused by overheating. 【𝟑𝟔𝟓 𝐃𝐀𝐘𝐒 𝐖𝐀𝐑𝐑𝐀𝐍𝐓𝐘】-- The product 8544771 dryer heating element kit supports 365 days return and exchange.Risk-free shopping, If you have any quality problem during warranty period, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem.It can fix the following symptoms:①dryer too hot,②no heat or not enough heat, ④takes too long to dry,⑤will not start.To confirm that the heating element is faulty, unplug the dryer when the symptom occurs. 【𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐈𝐓𝐘】-- 8544771 Dryer heating element replacement for Whirl-pool, Ken-more and more brand dryer.►8544771 Dryer heater element replace: W10836011, WP8544771VP, 1180054, AP6013115, PS11746337, etc.►279973 Thermal fuse replace: 3391913, 3404151, 3404152, 3977395, 8318314, AP3094323, PS334387, etc.►279816 Thermal fuse replace : 3399848, 3977393, 2651, AP3094244, PS334299, EAP334299, etc.►3392519 Thermal fuse replace : 80005, 694511, 3388651, 3392519, ET401, WP3392519VP, etc. 【𝐄𝐀𝐒𝐘 𝐓𝐎 𝐈𝐍𝐒𝐓𝐀𝐋𝐋𝐓𝐈𝐎𝐍】-- Installing the 8544771 dryer heating element kit is very simple.①Remove the three panels,disconnect the sensor,unscrewthe assembly and remove it.②Remove the three panels,disconnect the sensor,unscrewthe assembly and remove it.③Remove the front cross member, and then ofthemachine, lift the belt and then removethe drum.④Remove the terminals,unscrew ancreplace the old heating element.⑤After installing the new heatingelement and reassemble them in thedisassembly order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81xR7oTEqeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083QWN61H","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-119621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083QWN61H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083QWN61H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
