window.products.push({"id":119743,"name":"DC62-30314K Washer Water Inlet Valve by Beaquicy - OEM Hot Water Inlet Valve - Replacement for Sam-sung Ken-more Washing Machine - Repalces DC62-30314","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xqk+bD5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝑶𝑬𝑴 𝑫𝑪𝟔𝟐-𝟑𝟎𝟑𝟏𝟒𝑲 𝑰𝑵𝑳𝑬𝑻 𝑾𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹 𝑽𝑨𝑳𝑽𝑬】: The Genuine OEM Part DC62-30314K Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve is a single-coil valve on the hot water side, which controls the water flow of the washing machine. The electrical specification of DC62-30314K Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve is 120V / 60Hz. ➤If your washing machine has no hot water or warm water circulation causes the motherboard to malfunction, water leakage and other symptoms, you need to replace DC62-30314K Washer Hot Water Inlet Valve. 【𝑷𝑳𝑨𝑺𝑻𝑰𝑪 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑺𝑻𝑨𝑰𝑵𝑳𝑬𝑺𝑺 𝑺𝑻𝑬𝑬𝑳 𝑴𝑬𝑻𝑨𝑳 𝑴𝑨𝑻𝑬𝑹𝑰𝑨𝑳】: The package includes 1 x DC62-30314K Washer Hot Water Inlet Valve. The size of DC62-30314k Sam-sung washer water inlet valve is 3.1 x 2.5 x 2.2 inches. ➤The OEM DC62-30314K Water Valve is made of high-quality durable metal and ABS plastic materials. The metal part is stainless steel metal, which can better resist the moisture inside the washing machine and is less likely to rust, extending the life of the water valve. The plastic part guarantees the sturdiness of the water valve by increasing the thickness of the wall while maintaining its dimensions. 【𝟗𝟎 𝑫𝑨𝒀𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀】: The GENUINE DC62-30314K Washer Water Inlet Valve supports 90 DAYS return and exchange. ➤This DC62-30314K water inlet valve comes with a screen at the water inlet to effectively filter impurities from the water, making the water entering the washing machine cleaner and preventing the possibility of impurities entering the washing machine causing scratches and noise. The upgraded version of the water valve has improved the linking process at the seams so that the valve is less likely to break and crack. 【𝑯𝑰𝑮𝑯 𝑪𝑶𝑴𝑷𝑨𝑻𝑰𝑩𝑰𝑳𝑰𝑻𝒀】: The Genuine OEM Part of Washing Machine Water Inlet Valve DC62-30314K can replacement for Ken-more, Sam-sung washer. ➤Replaces for DC62-30314H, 1810145, AP4204535, PS4209100, EAP4209100. ➤DC62-30314K Water Inlet Valve compatible: 40249032010, 40249032011, 40249032012, WF328AAWXAA0000, WF328AAWXAA0001, WF328AAWXAA0002, WF350ANRXAA0000, WF405ATPAWRAA0000, WF405ATPAWRAA0001, WF206ANSXAA0000, WF331ANRXAA0004, WF328AARXAA0000, WF328AARXAA0001, WF328AARXAA0002, WF350ANWXAA0000, WF337AAWXAA, WF409ANWXAA, WF306LAWXAA0000, WF511ABWXAA0002, WF511ABWXAA0003, WF316LASXAA0000, WF306BHW/XAA, WF316BAW/XAA, WF339AAW/XAA, WF520ABP/XAA, WF410ANW/XAA, WF206BNW/XAC, etc. 【𝑬𝑨𝑺𝒀 𝑫𝑰𝒀 𝑭𝑰𝑿】: The DC62-30314K Water Inlet Valve Genuine OEM Part is quite easy to install, and the washing machine can be repaired in 15 minutes. The wires are color-coded,please take pictures carefully before removing the old valve, or mark the color of the wires on the valve body to ensure quick and correct installation. It is worth noting that, before any maintenance, turn off the power and water supply switches of the washing machine and wear work gloves to protect your hands. Open the back cover of the washer, find the water valve, remove the fixed screw, disconnect the water pipe and wire. Replace the water valve with a new one and install it as it was before.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Xqk+bD5xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B083DQ39YC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-119743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083DQ39YC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B083DQ39YC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
